{
  "intro": [
    {
      "text": "HUMAN!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "HMMM...\nHOW DO I SAY\nTHIS...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU WERE TAKING A\nLONG TIME TO\nARRIVE, SO...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I DECIDED TO\nIMPROVE THIS\nPUZZLE...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "BY ARRANGING THE\nSNOW TO LOOK MORE\nLIKE MY FACE.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "UNFORTUNATELY,\nTHE SNOW FROZE\nTO THE GROUND.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "NOW THE SOLUTION\nIS DIFFERENT!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "AND,AS USUAL, MY\nLAZY BROTHER IS\nNOWHERE AROUND.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I SUPPOSE WHAT\nI AM SAYING\nIS...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "WORRY NOT, HUMAN!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I, THE GREAT\nPAPYRUS, WILL SOLVE\nTHIS CONUNDRUM!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THEN WE CAN BOTH\nPROCEED!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "MEANWHILE, FEEL\nFREE TO TRY THE\nPUZZLE YOURSELF!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'LL TRY NOT TO\nGIVE AWAY THE\nANSWER!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "solved": [
    {
      "text": "WOW!!!\nYOU SOLVED IT!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "AND YOU DID IT\nALL WITHOUT MY\nHELP...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "INCREDIBLE!\nI'M IMPRESSED!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU MUST CARE\nABOUT PUZZLES\nLIKE I DO!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "WELL, I'M SURE\nYOU'LL LOVE THE\nNEXT PUZZLE THEN!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IT MIGHT EVEN\nBE TOO EASY FOR\nYOU!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "NYEH!\nHEH HEH!\nHEHEHEH!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
